      "scenario": "Partially started or unhealthy stack; readiness timeout; restart after persistent data was written",
      "oracle": "Report the failing service and observed readiness state. Compatible owned recovery retains instance identity and durable data; unsafe recovery stops for a deliberate action. Running containers alone never qualify success.",
